  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"We will do so, my father, when it is time.\"",
  "[action] Wang Lung forgets his question.",
  "the eldest son (to the eldest son): \"Well, well, and what are you doing here?\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"I am come back to my land,\"",
